+/*
+ * v3 RAIDZ2-native (RAID6) array.  The disks are laid out like a v2
+ * multi-volume filesystem, but total_size is the usable (data-column)
+ * capacity rather than the sum of the disks, and DATA/DIRENT blockrefs
+ * name their disk in bref->copyid (see hammer2_get_bref_fd()).
+ *
